      "writtenOn": "2026-06-13T12:11:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alternative wiring proposed in Ifbd3fda6.\n\nDrops the ProxyAddressProvider interface, ProxyAddressProviderBypass marker, Guice binding, and JettyServer implementing the interface. The contract becomes a single public constant on RemoteUserUtil (PROXY_REMOTE_ADDRESS_ATTR): customizer writes the pre-X-Forwarded-* TCP peer into the request attribute, RemoteUserUtil reads it back, falls back to req.getRemoteAddr().\n\nSame auth behaviour. Non-Jetty layers (Tomcat valve, plain filter) opt in by setting the same attribute. WDYT?",
      "revId": "0660a8ed34b51c54fe491e25aa046c9b9135a5af",
